00:56:16.000 --> 00:56:18.000
Dr. Khalifa: 63.

00:56:19.000 --> 00:56:20.000
Catherine: The Hypocrites (Al-Munaafeqoon)

00:56:20.000 --> 00:56:23.000
In the name of God, Most Gracious, Most Merciful

00:56:23.000 --> 00:56:33.000
[63:1] The hypocrites come to you and say, "We bear witness that you are the messenger of GOD."* GOD knows that you are His messenger, and GOD bears witness that the hypocrites are liars.

00:56:34.000 --> 00:56:40.000
[63:2] They used their oaths to deceive and to repel others from the path of GOD. Evil indeed is what they do.

00:56:40.000 --> 00:56:47.000
[63:3] They have believed, then disbelieved. Consequently, their hearts were sealed and consequently, they cannot understand.

00:56:47.000 --> 00:57:01.000
[63:4] When you see them, you may be impressed by their appearance. And when they speak, you hear their voice. But they are like wooden logs. They think that every cry is intended against them. Beware of them. GOD curses them for they have deviated.

00:57:01.000 --> 00:57:07.000
[63:5] When they are told, "Come let the messenger of GOD ask forgiveness for you," they turn their heads away, repulsed by their arrogance.

00:57:08.000 --> 00:57:16.000
[63:6] Whether you ask forgiveness for them, or do not ask forgiveness for them, GOD will not forgive them. GOD does not guide the wicked people.

00:57:16.000 --> 00:57:28.000
[63:7] They are the ones who say, "Do not give any charity to those who followed the messenger of GOD, that they may abandon him!" To GOD belongs the treasures of the heavens and the earth, but the hypocrites do not understand.

00:57:28.000 --> 00:57:39.000
[63:8] They say, "If we return to the city, the powerful will displace the weak therefrom." All dignity and power belong to GOD and to His messenger, and the believers. But the hypocrites do not know.

00:57:41.000 --> 00:57:48.000
Verse 1, the footnote says, even though the hypocrites are uttering a truth, God calls them liars,

00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:56.000
teaches us that we must reject all fabrications attributed to the prophet in the name of Hadith even if such Hadith narrates a truth.

00:57:56.000 --> 00:58:02.000
The fabrication of a good Hadith is the bait that Satan uses to cover a deadly hook.

00:58:03.000 --> 00:58:09.000
There are many people who are very talented with words in their individual languages.

00:58:10.000 --> 00:58:20.000
And how scriptures and Hadiths and the oral traditions in Jewish faith and so on came to be

00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:28.000
was those human beings who were very talented with words took the truth and elaborated upon them to the point where they became

00:58:28.000 --> 00:58:34.000
man-made laws, regulations, suggestions, traditions,

00:58:34.000 --> 00:58:41.000
to the point where those became the truth that people followed as opposed to the real message which was at the core originally.

00:58:41.000 --> 00:58:46.000
There is some truth, some veracity to what we hear in all things.

00:58:47.000 --> 00:58:55.000
The test is to figure out where it is and what it is. If you know what the truth is from the beginning, you can recognize the distortions.

00:58:55.000 --> 00:58:59.000
Sometimes they're so well done that it's hard to argue with people.

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:04.000
Because you're not as well, you're not as articulate as they are for instance.

00:59:04.000 --> 00:59:12.000
Some people are very articulate, very well versed with the words and very good abstract thinkers if I can use that phrase. And I'm not.

00:59:12.000 --> 00:59:15.000
I just know what the truth is, thank God.

00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:19.000
And when it starts, it's so complicated that it's hard to find it in, in what I'm hearing,

00:59:19.000 --> 00:59:24.000
I have to stop that and I have to say "no." There is a bottom line here.

00:59:24.000 --> 00:59:33.000
God says, even if there's truth in what we hear mixed in with the distortion, we're to discard all of it because it is a game

00:59:33.000 --> 00:59:36.000
and it's Satan's game. This is a person's game that's (unintelligible).

00:59:36.000 --> 00:59:38.000
It's Satan's game.

00:59:38.000 --> 00:59:46.000
Satan's out to bring us on those things that we're perhaps not as sure about, not as, as able to argue about

00:59:46.000 --> 00:59:49.000
to get us to go to him and forget God alone.

00:59:49.000 --> 00:59:55.000
And this is really difficult because this is in the media, this is in the newspapers. It's everywhere.

00:59:55.000 --> 01:00:00.000
It's everywhere. It's in comedy. It is on sweet time.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:04.000
I mean, the distortions are everywhere, and the truth is always buried in there somewhere.

01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:11.000
It's almost like playing chess, you know, when it's your turn to move, you have to walk very carefully to the next square

01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:15.000
because there's so much of that stuff all around us.

01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:18.000
Catherine: And it's, it's stuff, don't laugh.

01:00:18.000 --> 01:00:21.000
Dr. Khalifa: (unintelligible). Chess.

01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:22.000
Catherine: Chess.

01:00:22.000 --> 01:00:24.000
That's (unintelligible). No doubt.

01:00:25.000 --> 01:00:25.000
A woman: (unintelligible)

01:00:25.000 --> 01:00:26.000
Catherine: Ok.

01:00:27.000 --> 01:00:32.000
[63:2] They used their oaths to deceive and to repel others from the path of GOD. Evil indeed is what they do.

01:00:32.000 --> 01:00:37.000
[63:3] They have believed, then disbelieved. Consequently, their hearts were sealed and ..., they cannot understand.

01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:41.000
Once a person has believed and then disbelieved, they're done.

01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:46.000
God will continue to support that person throughout their life here,

01:00:46.000 --> 01:00:51.000
and give them even the things that they want, but they'll never get to the truth.

01:00:52.000 --> 01:00:56.000
Once they had had it, and gave it up, they won't be able to come back.

01:00:57.000 --> 01:01:01.000
And God is, is very definite in this verse about that.

01:01:01.000 --> 01:01:09.000
And then, goes on to describe them as if they were wooden logs. And we may be impressed, as I said earlier, by their appearance, by the...

01:01:12.000 --> 01:01:13.000
Verse 8 says that

01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:21.000
[63:8] ... All dignity and power belong to GOD ... to His messenger, and the believers. But the hypocrites do not know.

01:01:21.000 --> 01:01:25.000
We are provided for. Everything we need is provided for.

01:01:25.000 --> 01:01:33.000
So, when people who don't understand that plot and scheme to prevent us from getting the things that we're supposed to get,

01:01:33.000 --> 01:01:34.000
it's totally useless.

01:01:34.000 --> 01:01:38.000
We get what we're supposed to get from God, not from anyone else.

01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:46.000
So, those schemes and, and plans to disrupt or disband or, or fight with

01:01:46.000 --> 01:01:49.000
don't go anywhere. They're diffused before they ever get off the ground.

01:01:49.000 --> 01:01:55.000
What they do do is keep those people occupied and out of our business while we go about it.

01:01:56.000 --> 01:02:02.000
Because they're busy doing things that are, are fruitless. And that's a form of protection for us as well.

01:02:02.000 --> 01:02:05.000
Because we know that we can't be hurt by them.

01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:13.000
