01:13:37.000 --> 01:13:38.000
A woman: Mã Shã Allãh A woman: Mã Shã Allãh

01:13:39.000 --> 01:13:42.000
Dr. Khalifa: And she didn't even know that her address was a multiple of 19.

01:13:46.000 --> 01:13:48.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, this is why she came to Tucson.

01:13:49.000 --> 01:13:51.000
A woman: Celebrating her birthday, IN SHAA ALLAH

01:13:51.000 --> 01:13:52.000
Dr. Khalifa: Celebrating her birthday with us.

01:13:52.000 --> 01:14:00.000
There are so many things that I need, we need to do. We read Al-Fãtehah for Soad, remember? Because of her tests.

01:14:01.000 --> 01:14:02.000
Well, she passed.

01:14:10.000 --> 01:14:12.000
But there's another big test coming up.

01:14:17.000 --> 01:14:23.000
And she's, she's greedy again. And she wants us to read Sura Al-Fãtehah for her.

01:14:23.000 --> 01:14:25.000
God never turns us down.

01:14:27.000 --> 01:14:35.000
Dr. Khalifa: And Ahmad needs that we ask Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala to help him with his PhD exam. It's Monday?

01:14:35.000 --> 01:14:36.000
A woman: Ok. (unintelligible)

01:14:37.000 --> 01:14:38.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:40.000
Dr. Khalifa: Of course. A woman: (unintelligible)

01:14:40.000 --> 01:14:43.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes, you better. You better ask.

01:14:46.000 --> 01:14:48.000
God is generous. God is generous.

01:14:48.000 --> 01:14:52.000
And we have a perfect record so far, Alhamdu Lillah.

01:14:53.000 --> 01:14:59.000
God never never turns us down. Strange things we asked for. And He never turned us down.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:05.000
We even overturned governments. We did that.

01:15:06.000 --> 01:15:09.000
What else? You're supposed to remind me.

01:15:10.000 --> 01:15:13.000
Dr. Khalifa: Who else asked for Al-Fãtehah? Huh?

01:15:13.000 --> 01:15:15.000
A person: (unintelligible)

01:15:15.000 --> 01:15:21.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes, we recited Al-Fãtehah for Linda Baroni because she's, she had some infection in the hospital. She's alright.

01:15:23.000 --> 01:15:27.000
We want to take advantage of Jahan's presence so he'll be our teacher next week.

